### ========== 배송지 API ==========

### 배송지 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/addresses
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

### 배송지 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

{
  "receiverName": "홍길동",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678",
  "zipCode": "12345",
  "addressLine1": "서울시 강남구 테헤란로 123",
  "addressLine2": "4층 401호"
}

### 배송지 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/addresses/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@

{
  "receiverName": "김철수",
  "phone": "010-9876-5432",
  "zipCode": "54321",
  "addressLine1": "부산시 해운대구 해운대로 456",
  "addressLine2": "3층 302호"
}

### 배송지 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me/addresses/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: nahyeon
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Hx7!mK2@
